  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**K+(1)/(K)=-3**\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\nIf X + 1/X = a, then\n\nX³ + 1/X³ = a³ - 3a\n\nX² + 1/X² = a² - 2\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nK+(1)/(K)=-3\n\n2(K³+(1)/(K³))=2( -27 + 9) = -36\n\nK²+(1)/(K²)=9-2=7\n\n**-36 + 7 = -29**",
